{
  "file" : "npc/re/merchants/enchantgrade.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 12,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 13,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Hello, dear customer who walked in, let's hope for a miracle today."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 14,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 16,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Enhance the equipment's grade."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 16,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Exchange Etel items"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 16,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "What is Grade Enhancement?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Our customer. You want to enhance the grade of equipment."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "It is not easy to move the magical power of jewels."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Magical power can explode on the spot."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Then the weapon that will inherit the magical power also explodes!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "I'll still do it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "I'll think about it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "I wish good luck to our courageous customers!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Whenever you have the courage to challenge, please come back."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "These are jewels used to enhance grades."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Etel Dust, the jewels that will be the base, and if you give me a small fee I'll exchange it for Etel jewels."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Occasionally, unstable jewels with a lot of pure magical power are found."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "We call these etheric gems, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "You can transfer the magical power of the etheric gem to other weapons, but of course there is some risk."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "It's delicate, so if you aren't careful, pop! It will explode."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Anyway, if you use this etheric gem, you can enhance the weapon you are using."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "Performance gets better. We call this grade enhancement."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "[Sratos]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "You too, wouldn't you be happy if the weapons you love grow one step further?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Sratos",
      "text" : "We are the people who assist it. It's a bit risky, though. ahahaha."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "May good luck always be with you!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Welcome to Paramarket's Grade Enhancement Center~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Enhance the equipment's grade."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Exchange Etel items"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "What is Grade Enhancement?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Do you want to unlock the potential of your favorite equipment?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Explosions may also occur in the process of dealing with magical powers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Still, if you're trying to enhance your grade... !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "I, Suribell, will do my best!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "I'll still do it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "I'll think about it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Let's hold hands and have faith! Try clenching your teeth!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Okay! Let's drink a glass of cold water!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "You need etheric gems to enhance grades!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "If you combine Etel Dust and jewels to make it, it is fine! An Etel jewel for adventurers is complete!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Would you like to combine jewels and Etel Dust?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Occasionally, unstable jewels with a lot of pure magical power are found."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "I decided to call such gems etheric gems."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "Who? I am Suribell!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "The magical power of etheric gems sometimes awakens the hidden potential of equipment."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "We call it grade enhancement because it goes up one tier!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "[Suribell]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "The adventurer may have a potential that is unknown to him."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Suribell",
      "text" : "There is a risk that it can be destroyed if done wrong, but try it with faith!"
    }
  ]
}